-- Every fact below was verified against the OFFICIAL posting:
-- UN Careers (UNIC), UNDP Careers (UNOCHA), phasenepal.org (PHASE).
-- Where the official posting did not state a fact (post counts for the
-- two UN roles), the article says so instead of guessing.
-- UNOCHA deadline: the official page reads "Apply Before 25/10/2026,
